Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:01.94,Default,,0,0,150,,Coming up on {\i1}Punirunes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, pet it, take care of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's play, Punirunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is squishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Punirunes. Before we knew it, these creatures\Nbegan to inhabit the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're squishsterious and soft to the touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They all love to be squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're kachi-freezy and hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,These are some merry, adorable puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, there could be\Na Punirune right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.65,0:00:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Angelrune's Rival Devilrune{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.82,0:00:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Punirunes are playing merrily as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:00:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Angelrune's with them too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ururune's pondering what to make\Nwith the wooden blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Angelrune's arrows bring luck to those they strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If Ururune is hit, it should come up with a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Angelrune's aim isn't too good,\Nbut who knows how it will go today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.29,0:01:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Devilrune.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devilrune is Angelrune's rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's bent on besting Angelrune at everything—\Nthough this is entirely one-sided.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:02:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I caught your arrow! Don't you feel so frustrated?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.73,0:02:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But Angelrune reponds...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"You caught a flying arrow! Amazing!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airune asked to play,\Nbut Devilrune didn't seem interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devilrune has an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it can make a taller wooden block building,\Nthen that should frustrate Angelrune.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devilrune's fully motivated!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Check it, mine is bigger!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.34,0:03:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It didn't play out as Devilrune imagined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devilrune has another idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If it eats faster,\Nthen that should frustrate Angelrune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing is going Devilrune's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! What should I watch next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're enjoying yourself,\Nbut maybe cinnamon roll back your screen time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! I'll take your words to tart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two Airune's friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Are you interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's watch it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.36,0:04:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting I take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I will, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad idea either.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.35,0:05:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop? Go on? Stop? Go on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop? Go on? Stop?! Go on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah, I don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like an angel's whispering in my ear\Nwhile a devil is tempting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel and a devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bread...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My brand new bread, centered on the harmony\Nof sweetness and spiciness: the Angel and Devil Bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me come up with the best idea ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Angelrune. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! I'm gonna start making it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Angel and devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"You got us praise, Devilrune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"What's the matter?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Nothin'."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Are you sure?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I wanna beat Angelrune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Have you not?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I wanna do better than that!\NI wanna really face Angelrune and really beat it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Is that all you want?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Of course!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Are you sure?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.42,0:07:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to follow Dad's example\Nand come up with a new cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't come up with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.37,0:07:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If Angelrune's arrow strikes her,\Nshe should come up with a lucky idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It hit Angelrune.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, your face is as red as an apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what my new cake was missing!\NFresh apple tartness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How about an apple cheescake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.70,0:08:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.58,0:08:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Angelrune's arrow missed its target,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but Mom got her luck in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.01,0:08:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.27,0:09:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Rolled ice punieam!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep! As thanks for helping me come up with an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Angelrune, you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.16,0:09:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.79,0:09:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Devilrune, is it? Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.34,0:09:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Angelrune, Devilrune, you must be real good friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devilrune would rather remain\NAngelrune's biggest rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-Pal Files!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Angelrune and Devilrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're hit by Angelrune's bow and arrow,\Nit gives you luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But it has a bad aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Angelrune has a self-proclaimed rival: Devilrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.88,0:10:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting I take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Puni-Pal Squestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.93,0:10:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Devilrune say to Dad after this\Nto try to counter Angelrune?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(562.67,403.33)}1. Go to sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(562.67,718)}2. Keep watching
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a1\pos(562.67,1003.33)}3. Start dancing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad idea either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.45,0:10:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,2. Keep watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention! It's time for the\NGrand Puni School Field Day to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, there's so many squishy versions\Nof activities! It looks like so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing your best too, right, Airune?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Airune, all of you! Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.87,0:12:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "The Field Day at Puni School{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Puni" in next time!
